# Silica keeps these files LF on every platform: the pack identity hash
# (SPEC.md §6/D11) and the golden manifest parser (tests/golden.rs)
# both reject CRLF, and Rust sources must not gain CRs either.
*.toml text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
tests/golden/manifest.txt text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
